<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">NOW, THEREFORE, the Parties hereby agree as follows:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Article 1 Particulars of the Target Company</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>1.1 Overview of the Target Company.</B> The
Target Company is Qingdao Quanao Supply Chain Technology Co., Ltd., with Unified Social Credit Code 91370200MA3N8Y1D2D, whose legal representative
is Zhang Hongzhen, with a registered capital of RMB 26,666,700, established on September 18, 2018, of enterprise type &ldquo;Other Joint
Stock Company (Unlisted)&rdquo;, with registered address at Room 2001, Block B, Qingdao International Innovation Park, No. 1 Keyuanwei
1st Road, Laoshan District, Qingdao, Shandong Province. The Target Company is principally engaged in supply chain management services,
import and export agency, procurement agency services and other businesses, and owns businesses and assets including the Quanao Supply
Chain Service Technology Platform, the Quanao Food Procurement System, the Quanao Supply Chain Management Technology Platform and the
Quanao Food Trading Mall.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>1.2 Guarantees and Liabilities of the Target
Company:</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(1)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The Target Company has bank loans and other liabilities; details
of the Target Company&rsquo;s liabilities as of June 30, 2026 are set out in <B>Schedule 1</B>; details of guarantees provided to third
parties are set out in <B>Schedule 2</B>;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(2)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The Sellers have provided Party A with the Target Company&rsquo;s
