</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Article 2 Purchase and Sale of the Target Company</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>2.1 Sale and Purchase (Phased Implementation).</B>
The transactions contemplated under this Agreement shall be implemented in phases:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(1)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><B>First Phase</B>: Seller One agrees, on the terms and conditions
set forth in this Agreement, to sell to the Buyer 33.33% of the equity interest in the Target Company (i.e., 33.33% of the entire equity
interest of the Target Company) held by Seller One; and the Buyer agrees to purchase such equity interest on the terms and conditions
set forth in this Agreement. Upon completion of the First Phase transaction, the Buyer shall hold 33.33% of the equity interest in the
Target Company, Seller One shall hold 50.92% of the equity interest in the Target Company, and Seller Two shall hold 15.75% of the equity
interest in the Target Company.</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(2)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><B>Subsequent Acquisitions</B>: Based on the business developments
after completion of the First Phase acquisition and the Buyer&rsquo;s business planning, the Buyer shall have the right (but not the
obligation) to continue to acquire the remaining equity interests held by the Sellers until the entire equity interest in the Target
Company has been acquired. The proportion, consideration and specific terms of any subsequent acquisition shall be negotiated and agreed
by the Parties at that time with reference to the overall valuation principles set forth in this Agreement, and shall be set forth in
a separate written agreement. If the cumulative proportion of the Target Company&rsquo;s equity interest acquired by the Buyer exceeds
50% as of any phase, the Sellers shall cooperate in signing the full set of VIE agreements and shall pledge all of the Target Company&rsquo;s
equity interest to the Buyer; the closing conditions precedent, asset and business rectification, performance milestone unlocking, pledge
and registration arrangements of the subsequent acquisitions shall, in principle, be implemented by reference to the provisions of this
Agreement.</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>2.2 Asset and Business Rectification Period.</B>
This transaction sets a maximum six-month asset and business rectification period (the &ldquo;<B>Asset and Business Rectification Period</B>&rdquo;),
commencing from the date of execution of this Agreement. The Sellers undertake to complete the rectification of the Target Company&rsquo;s
credit and debt relationships and related encumbrances during the Asset and Business Rectification Period, so as to ensure that the Target
Company reaches a state that is available for normal operation by the Buyer, without any impediment.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>


