<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>Article 3 Consideration and Payment</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>3.1 Overall Valuation and Consideration.</B>
The Parties confirm that the overall valuation of one hundred percent (100%) of the equity interest in the Target Company is USD 75,000,000
(in words: Seventy-Five Million U.S. Dollars). The consideration for the First Phase under this Agreement is USD 25,000,000 (in words:
Twenty-Five Million U.S. Dollars), corresponding to the 33.33% equity interest in the Target Company to be acquired by the Buyer in the
First Phase. The consideration for any subsequent acquisition shall be negotiated and agreed by the Parties by reference to the foregoing
overall valuation.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>3.2 Form of Payment.</B> The Buyer shall pay
the entire First Phase consideration by newly issuing ordinary shares of YMT to Seller One. The number of consideration ordinary shares
equals the First Phase consideration divided by the Issue Price.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>3.3 Issue Price and Share Quantity.</B> The
Issue Price is the arithmetic mean of the closing prices of YMT&rsquo;s listed trading stock (i.e., ADSs, with each ADS corresponding
to 6,000 ordinary shares as of the date of this Agreement) on the Nasdaq market for five (5) consecutive trading days prior to September
19, 2026 (the <B>Pricing Reference Date</B>, the Pricing Reference Date itself excluded), namely September 14, 15, 16, 17 and 18, 2026,
i.e., USD 2.06 per ADS. Calculated on this basis, the First Phase consideration is equivalent to 12,135,922 ADSs, corresponding to 72,815,532,000
ordinary shares (based on the ratio in effect on the date of this Agreement). When any ordinary shares subsequently issued are converted
into ADSs, conversion shall be made at the ratio then in effect on the conversion date.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>3.4 Issuance of Shares.</B> Upon execution
of this Agreement and the satisfaction of the closing conditions, the Buyer shall, within ten (10) business days, issue the consideration
shares and register them in the share register. However, the share certificates shall not be delivered to the Sellers during the Asset
and Business Rectification Period.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>3.5 Conditions for Share Delivery.</B> The
shares may be delivered to the Sellers only after all of the following conditions have been satisfied:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(1)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">the Asset and Business Rectification Period has expired;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(2)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">the Target Company has no undisclosed debt or encumbrances,
and the Target Company&rsquo;s businesses and assets are entirely in a state available for normal operation by the Buyer, without any
impediment;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(3)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">the Sellers&rsquo; representations and warranties under this
Agreement are true, accurate and complete as of the expiration of the Asset and Business Rectification Period;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(4)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">the net asset value of the Target Company has increased by not
less than USD 15,000,000 (in words: Fifteen Million U.S. Dollars) as compared with that of June 30, 2026.</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>3.6 Transfer Restrictions After Delivery.</B>
After the Asset and Business Rectification Period expires and the delivery conditions are satisfied, the Sellers may convert such shares
into ADSs and trade them on the Nasdaq market; however, from the <B>Trade-Start Date</B> and unless waived or adjusted in writing by the
Sellers&rsquo; Cayman company, the following transfer restrictions shall apply:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(1)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">a six-month lock-up from the Trade-Start Date;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

