within ten (10) business days after all conditions precedent specified in Article 4 have been satisfied or waived, or at such other time
and place as the Parties may otherwise agree in writing.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>7.2 Closing Documents.</B> At Closing, the
Sellers shall deliver to the Buyer the title documents, valuation reports and other documents of the Target Company; the Buyer shall issue
the consideration shares in accordance with the foregoing provisions.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>7.3 Post-Closing Obligations.</B> After the
Closing, the Sellers shall continue to cooperate with the Buyer in completing financial treatment and information disclosure and other
