<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Article 10 Confidentiality</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Parties shall be bound by a strict duty of
confidentiality with respect to the existence and terms of this Agreement and any non-public information (collectively, &ldquo;<B>Confidential
Information</B>&rdquo;) such as trade secrets, technical secrets, financial information, customer information, etc. of the other Party
learned in the course of negotiation, execution and performance of this Agreement. Without the prior written consent of the other Party,
no Party may disclose Confidential Information to any third party, except where disclosure is required by laws and regulations, regulatory
requirements or judicial/arbitral proceedings.</P>


<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Article 11 Termination of the Agreement</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>11.1 This Agreement may be terminated in the
following circumstances:</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(1)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The actual controller of the Buyer changes from Deng Jinhong
to any other person without the prior written consent of the Sellers;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(2)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The Parties enter into a written agreement to terminate this
Agreement;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(3)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">A Party materially breaches this Agreement and fails to remedy
such breach in a manner satisfactory to the non-breaching Party within thirty (30) days after receipt of written notice from the non-breaching
Party, in which case the non-breaching Party shall have the right to terminate this Agreement by written notice to the other Party;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(4)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The conditions precedent set forth in this Agreement fail to
be fully satisfied within the agreed period, and the Parties fail to reach consensus on an extension;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(5)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Upon expiration of the Asset and Business Rectification Period,
the Sellers have failed to satisfy all conditions set forth in this Agreement, in which case the Buyer shall have the right to terminate
this Agreement;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(6)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">Force majeure prevents the performance of this Agreement for
more than ninety (90) days;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(7)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">If, prior to the Closing, the Buyer&rsquo;s Cayman company is
determined by Nasdaq to be delisted, this Agreement shall be automatically terminated, the Sellers shall not be required to handle any
equity transfer procedures, and the Buyer shall compensate the Sellers for all transaction or rectification costs incurred in connection
therewith;</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="width: 0in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in; text-align: left">(8)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">If, after the Closing, the Buyer&rsquo;s Cayman company is determined
by Nasdaq to be delisted, or its stock is suspended from trading on a long-term basis and cannot be traded, or if it is determined that
the ordinary shares cannot be converted into ADSs, or if the registration of the Sellers&rsquo; shares has not taken effect, the Sellers
shall have the right to terminate the transaction and recover all transaction or rectification costs incurred in connection therewith.
The Buyer shall, within fifteen (15) business days, cooperate with the Sellers to complete the procedures for releasing the equity pledge.
All taxes and appraisal fees incurred in the course of the equity share-back shall be borne by the Buyer; if the Buyer delays cooperation
in the share-back, the Buyer shall pay the Sellers liquidated damages at the rate of 0.05% of the total transaction consideration per
day (if the time limit is exceeded by more than 15 business days for reasons not attributable to the Buyer, the Buyer shall not be deemed
to be in delay of cooperation).</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>11.2 Consequences of Termination.</B> Upon
termination of this Agreement, save for the provisions on confidentiality and dispute resolution and other surviving provisions, the Parties
shall use best efforts to restore to the status prior to execution. If the Sellers have received the consideration shares, such shares
shall be returned; if the Sellers have transferred part of the consideration shares, the proceeds from such transfer together with the
remaining shares shall be delivered to the Buyer. The equity interest of the Target Company that has been transferred (the 33.33% equity
interest of the Target Company transferred by Aoge under the First Phase) shall be returned to the corresponding Seller, and the shareholding
structure of the Target Company shall be restored to its pre-transaction status.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>


