<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Article 12 Governing Law and Dispute Resolution</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>12.1</B> The execution, validity, interpretation,
performance and dispute resolution of this Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the People&rsquo;s Republic of China (excluding
the laws of Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>12.2</B> Any dispute arising out of or in connection
with this Agreement shall first be resolved through friendly negotiation by the Parties. If the dispute cannot be resolved through negotiation,
the relevant Parties shall submit such dispute to the China International Economic and Trade Arbitration Commission for arbitration in
accordance with the arbitration rules then in effect at the commission, with the place of arbitration being Beijing. The arbitral tribunal
shall consist of three (3) arbitrators. The arbitral award shall be final and binding on the Parties to this Agreement. The prevailing
Party shall have the right to require the losing Party to bear all costs of vindicating its rights, including without limitation attorneys&rsquo;
fees, preservation fees, travel expenses and expert appraisal fees.</P>


<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: left"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>Article 13 Miscellaneous</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>13.1 Entire Agreement.</B> This Agreement constitutes
the entire agreement reached by the Parties with respect to this transaction, and supersedes all prior oral or written agreements, understandings
or arrangements reached by the Parties with respect to this transaction.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>13.2 Amendment.</B> Any amendment or supplement
to this Agreement shall be made in writing upon the consensus of all Parties through negotiation and shall become effective upon execution
by the Parties.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>13.3 Severability.</B> If any provision of
this Agreement is determined to be invalid or unenforceable, such provision shall be deemed severable and shall not affect the validity
of the other provisions of this Agreement.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>13.4 Notices.</B> Any notice, request, consent
or other communication under this Agreement shall be made in writing and shall be delivered by personal delivery, registered mail, fax
or email to the address set forth in the head of this Agreement or to such other address as the Parties may notify in writing.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>13.5 Counterparts.</B> This Agreement is made
in five (5) original counterparts, with the Buyer and the Sellers each holding two (2) counterparts and the Target Company holding one
(1) counterpart, each having equal legal effect.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

